{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "m3-grupo02-observabilidad",
  "title": "M3 · Grupo 02 · Conductores y Vehículos",
  "tags": [
    "utn-frre",
    "devops",
    "m3",
    "grupo02"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Grafana Cloud Metrics",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Conductores disponibles y habilitados",
      "description": "Gauge global de PostgreSQL. No sumar por réplica. Documentación vigente e intención APPLIED. No confirma ausencia de viaje activo. Sin datos no equivale a cero.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(m3_drivers_available{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Alta de conductor · promedio",
      "description": "Recepción HTTP a persistencia confirmada. Sólo éxitos. Actualización excluye replay y no incluye sincronización M4.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(m3_driver_registration_duration_seconds_sum{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\",outcome=\"success\",entry_point=\"http\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(m3_driver_registration_duration_seconds_count{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\",outcome=\"success\",entry_point=\"http\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Alta de conductor · p95",
      "description": "Percentil estimado por buckets. Requiere observaciones en la ventana; sin tráfico puede no haber valor.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(m3_driver_registration_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\",outcome=\"success\",entry_point=\"http\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Actualización operativa local · promedio",
      "description": "Recepción HTTP a persistencia confirmada. Sólo éxitos. Actualización excluye replay y no incluye sincronización M4.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(m3_driver_operational_state_update_duration_seconds_sum{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\",outcome=\"success\",entry_point=\"http\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(m3_driver_operational_state_update_duration_seconds_count{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\",outcome=\"success\",entry_point=\"http\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Actualización operativa local · p95",
      "description": "Percentil estimado por buckets. Requiere observaciones en la ventana; sin tráfico puede no haber valor.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(m3_driver_operational_state_update_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\",outcome=\"success\",entry_point=\"http\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Solicitudes HTTP por segundo",
      "description": "Incluye todas las rutas, también salud y login.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia HTTP · p95",
      "description": "Duración HTTP automática.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores HTTP 5xx · porcentaje",
      "description": "5xx / solicitudes. Sin tráfico el cociente no tiene valor; 4xx son rechazos del cliente.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\",http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU JVM · utilización",
      "description": "Promedio de utilización de los procesos JVM; no representa todos los contenedores.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * avg(jvm_cpu_recent_utilization_ratio{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memoria JVM usada",
      "description": "Memoria JVM agregada de las instancias; no es el RSS completo del contenedor.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 32
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{job=\"utn-frre/m3-drivers-vehicles\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Alcance y trazas",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Las tres métricas conservan las definiciones de la bitácora. El Gauge consulta cada 60 s y puede valer 0. La disponibilidad es la intención aplicada en M4, no el estado efectivo de viaje. Las duraciones terminan al confirmar persistencia local. En Explore, elegir Tempo y buscar `{ resource.service.name = \"m3-drivers-vehicles\" }`; abrir la traza de alta o cambio operativo y sus spans SQL. Los intentos fallidos están disponibles en los histogramas con `outcome=\"error\"`."
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  }
}
